proxy initialization
├── validator is zero or has no bytecode → implementation deployment reverts
├── implementation initializer is locked
├── proxy initializer cannot be replayed
├── zero admin, YieldManager, upgrader, or treasury → revert
├── authority or integration is zero or has no bytecode → revert
├── token or either oracle decimals invalid → revert
├── Curve coin order invalid → revert
├── yBOLD/st-yBOLD asset graph invalid → revert
└── configuration valid → persist proxy storage, defaults, and separated roles
